@api = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### Login (copy accessToken into @token below)
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@demo.local", "password": "Demo123!" }

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Current user
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tickets
GET {{api}}/tickets?status=New&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create ticket
POST {{api}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Brak połączenia z Wi-Fi",
  "description": "Laptop nie łączy się z siecią biurową",
  "categoryId": 3,
  "priority": "High"
}

### Dashboard (admin)
GET {{api}}/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ticket categories (any user)
GET {{api}}/ticket-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add ticket category (admin)
POST {{api}}/ticket-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Drukowanie", "description": "Problemy z drukarkami" }

### Inspection cards (staff: all, user: own devices only)
GET {{api}}/inspections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add inspection record (admin: approved at once, technician: pending)
POST {{api}}/inspections/1/records
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "Inspection", "performedAt": "2026-11-01", "cost": 150.50, "nextInspectionDate": null, "description": "Przegląd roczny" }

### Pending records (admin)
GET {{api}}/inspections/records/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve / reject a record (admin)
POST {{api}}/inspections/records/1/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approve": true }
